BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 394.17 Tm (system impact study, with grounding and foundations deliberately left unfinished, so anyone pricing land or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 378.95 Tm (headroom off a 30% set is pricing a moving number. primtech solutions attacks the same problem in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 363.72 Tm (software: BOM balloons flag unspecified items in red before a 30% design is handed off, and the same) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 348.50 Tm (check catches stray objects sitting at the origin, while reusable modules propagate changes everywhere) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 333.27 Tm (when edited, so one bad module repeats everywhere it is reused [2FBThdUqgRg @ 00:43:02]. For AI loads) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 318.05 Tm (with solid-state transformers, Keentel Engineering's rule of thumb is that behavior is assumed unless it is) Tj ET
