BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 257.15 Tm (1,500 MW of data center load dropped in 82 seconds after 6 faults, which has NERC, ERCOT and utilities) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 241.92 Tm (rewriting the rules for computational loads [u_aIABsRd0A @ 00:00:54]. SpeedFreakLS1 spells out the) Tj ET
