0.6 w 54.00 747.00 m 558.00 747.00 l S
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (Every practitioner who opened up a container described the same layered stack. The Energy Institute) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (speaker, who spent 24 years in oil and gas before moving into Toshiba-based integration, breaks a BESS) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (into five buckets. The first is cells and modules holding the chemistry. The second is racks carrying their own) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (battery management system. The third is the DC-to-AC conversion step. The fourth is a supervisory) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (controller deciding how racks are run, cooled and dispatched. The fifth is the grid or load where value is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (actually earned. A container, thermal management and fire protection wrap around all five [HhLc8bnBSIo @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (00:01:45]. Keentel Engineering walks the identical hierarchy: cells are grouped into modules, modules into) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (racks, and racks into DC battery blocks, with the PCS synchronizing that DC energy to the grid and running) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (in reverse to charge [M2z-pv6j-N4 @ 00:04:20]. Learn Solar & BESS frames the build as stacking LEGO) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (blocks in four steps, from a single lithium-ion cell up to rows of racks inside a climate-controlled shipping) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (container [Wc1MU3K4OEc @ 00:03:14]. The control layering is just as uniform. The BMS watches cell) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (voltages, temperatures, current and state of charge, and it immediately isolates affected components when) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (conditions go abnormal. The EMS sits above it, running charging schedules, market participation, grid) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (support and utility communications. Keentel says that pairing turns a pile of batteries into an autonomous) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (power plant [M2z-pv6j-N4 @ 00:05:04].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (The second point of agreement is that application decides the build before any hardware is picked. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (Energy Institute speaker's checklist covers the application, power versus capacity, and duration. It then asks) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm (whether the system cycles per hour, per day or per week, how much footprint is available, and which) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (customer codes apply, such as NFPA 55 or UL fire-propagation standards. It ends with lifetime cost of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.72 Tm (ownership, and the speaker calls power-or-capacity the number one question [HhLc8bnBSIo @ 00:06:11].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 411.50 Tm (Akash Koushik of Goodenough Energy, interviewed on Gaurav J - TheElectricalGuy, makes the same split) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 396.27 Tm (with an aircraft analogy. Ancillary-service BESS for primary and secondary frequency control is the military) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 381.05 Tm (jet, built for response and reliability. Arbitrage and peak-shaving units are the commercial airliner, tuned for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 365.82 Tm (round-trip efficiency, low auxiliary consumption and long life [Bg-6ClEVMSU @ 00:07:13]. On chemistry for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 350.60 Tm (stationary grid work, the default is LFP. Learn Solar & BESS reports that LFP takes over 80% of new) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 335.37 Tm (utility-scale projects, because open grid sites have space and can trade density for safety [Wc1MU3K4OEc) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 320.15 Tm (@ 00:04:13]. Cummins built its new containerized line on LFP at a 0.5C, two-hour rating. The PCS, isolation) Tj ET
