BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 369.65 Tm (ignoring wear: accounting for degradation cuts over 22% of annual net profit at 1 MWh and over 12% at 2) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 354.42 Tm (MWh, and the two mistakes flagged are ignoring degradation and oversizing [V57-D23t6Lo @ 00:03:44].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 339.20 Tm (Jerzy Kuzminski adds the contract sting: daily cycle caps can void warranties, so aggressive dispatch can) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 323.97 Tm (cost the owner warranty cover outright [fDBjJyTGWDQ @ 00:18:25]. Zami's charging advice points the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 308.75 Tm (same way, since fast charging leaves cells unbalanced and spreading a 4-hour battery's charge over 5-6) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 293.52 Tm (hours is better. The economics check is simple: every extra cycle has to earn more than the life it burns, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 278.30 Tm (the trader dispatching it rarely carries that cost.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 263.07 Tm (Contract and supplier traps come next. Jerzy Kuzminski reports a supplier that shipped a container plus) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 247.85 Tm (cells only, notes that warranties are multiplicative so three stacked 98% guarantees land at about 94%, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 232.62 Tm (warns that EMS fees can take 20-30% of arbitrage revenue while SCADA can cost as much as the container) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 217.40 Tm ([fDBjJyTGWDQ @ 00:22:19]. Kuzminski's rule is that technical specifications must be an annex to the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 202.17 Tm (contract, not a separate marketing document, because a quoted 92% round-trip efficiency becomes 85-87%) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 186.95 Tm (after three years [fDBjJyTGWDQ @ 00:23:17]. STG Nations Energy points out that neither the supplier nor) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 171.72 Tm (the EPC checks degradation, thermal runaway and grid-connection risk end to end, which is the gap it) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 156.50 Tm (pitches an independent engineer with zero supplier commissions to fill [AVf_DgVRB3w @ 00:05:25]. Andy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 141.27 Tm (Willis of Kona Energy says developers leave insurance too late; insurers belong in the room before design) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 126.05 Tm (and supplier choice, so battery and transformer suppliers get vetted for bankability [UI-9nmVEA9U @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 110.82 Tm (00:08:38]. Kuzminski also flags the integrator spread: 20-30 cell makers but hundreds of integrators, often) Tj ET
