BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 542.55 Tm (each supplier designs in isolation while 100-400 grouped units behave differently. The runaway loop is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 527.32 Tm (mechanical: a 45?C intake yields 55?C exhaust, and at 50% reingestion the intake climbs to 50?C and the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 512.10 Tm (exhaust to 60?C, driving derate, then thermal runaway and fire [LBt7MoTnFFQ @ 00:21:35]. In the Fort) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 496.87 Tm (Stockton case of about 320 containers, the worst condition was not calm air but a 7 mph southeast wind that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 481.65 Tm (left about 50% of units derated, while winds of 12-20 mph refreshed the aisles. Smith treats anything above) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 466.42 Tm (a couple of percentage points derated as adverse [LBt7MoTnFFQ @ 00:24:43]. The fix was 70? louvers on) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 451.20 Tm (the HVAC exhausts, with a check on fan pressure margin. It pulled aisles to 51-53?C against a 54?C intake) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 435.97 Tm (threshold and shifted the temperature histogram left, with less compressor wear [LBt7MoTnFFQ @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 420.75 Tm (00:27:17]. The Civil and Structural Engineer channel reports the dirt-level version of the same trap: ponding) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 405.52 Tm (after minimal rain, and roads fracturing before the battery is even connected, because the maximum) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 390.30 Tm (structural stress on the ground lands during the temporary construction phase [935Rt3dBZso @ 00:09:43].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 375.07 Tm (The channel's blunt rule: if water gathers beneath high voltage equipment, the facility fails.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 359.85 Tm (Keentel's Sandeep Sunny Patel names the protection trap. BESS fault current is software-limited, so) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 344.62 Tm (conventional overcurrent protection fails and directional or differential schemes are required [BTkszCEW7nY) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 329.40 Tm (@ 00:03:16]. Patel's verdict on teams that skip the studies is that they deferred risk without pricing it. On) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 314.17 Tm (weak, low-SCR grids the PLL itself can lose stability, which is why EMT modeling is required) Tj ET
