BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 397.50 Tm (moratoria as wins: Tulsa passed a nine-month moratorium, the Seminole Nation passed one unanimously,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 382.27 Tm (and the Muscogee blocked a resolution, all driven by town halls, tribal council meetings, door knocking,) Tj ET
